From 16e0943fa458a213362d498ff92a6893eb45b893 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: garymeyerca <220751193+garymeyerca@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 17:04:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] media: apple: isp: correct the T8122 PMU base address

The extra trailing zero places the PMU address outside the PMGR range
on J613. Correcting it resolves the probe-time firmware translation
fault on a J613 running firmware compatibility 14.7.

Hardware tested as a module override on the original PR95 kernel,
7.1.12-2-20261013.95-sep-ARCH. Rebased integration source has separate
hardware qualification pending.

Link: https://github.com/omacom/linux-aurora/issues/117
Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-6
---
 drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c
index 9f5f8f58b3748e..88a2e014fabc68 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c
@@ -653,7 +653,7 @@ static const struct apple_isp_hw apple_isp_hw_t6020 = {
 
 static const struct apple_isp_hw apple_isp_hw_t8122 = {
 	.gen = ISP_GEN_T8112,
-	.pmu_base = 0x2d07040000,
+	.pmu_base = 0x2d0704000,
 
 	.dsid_count = 1,
 	.dsid_clr_base0 = 0x2221c4000,

From 06d77374e80cb1901fb2c283362abb242cd68c18 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: garymeyerca <220751193+garymeyerca@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 17:04:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] media: apple: isp: use temporal filter zero on J613
 firmware 14.7

On the tested J613, m1n1 supplies temporal-filter=1. The PMU fix permits
startup but this filter yields no output frames. Selecting filter 0
delivers 1920x1080 NV12 at about 30 fps with the existing CNR, MBNR and
temporal processing commands retained.

Limit the workaround to J613, firmware compatibility 14.7, and filter 1.
This complements the 26.6.2 camera work; that firmware's processing
strategy is unchanged.

Hardware tested as a module override on the original PR95 kernel.
Rebased integration source has separate hardware qualification pending.

Link: https://github.com/omacom/linux-aurora/issues/117
Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-6
---
 drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c
index 88a2e014fabc68..495c8fd822332a 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-drv.c
@@ -407,6 +407,14 @@ static int apple_isp_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	if (err)
 		isp->temporal_filter = 0;
 
+	/* J613 firmware 14.7 stalls capture with temporal filter 1. */
+	if (of_machine_is_compatible("apple,j613") &&
+	    isp->fw_compat == ISP_FIRMWARE_V_14_7 &&
+	    isp->temporal_filter == 1) {
+		dev_info(dev, "using temporal filter 0 on J613 firmware 14.7\n");
+		isp->temporal_filter = 0;
+	}
+
 	err = apple_isp_init_presets(isp);
 	if (err) {
 		dev_err(dev, "failed to initialize presets\n");
